["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Links a vulnerability and one or more elements designating the latter as products\nnot affected by the vulnerability.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
